title: 'Use compressed runtimes & log errors in parachain runtime upgrades'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Add `submit_sudo_runtime_upgrade` helper to `cumulus-zombienet-sdk-helpers`
    that submits a sudo runtime upgrade, waits for finalization, and verifies
    the inner dispatch succeeded via the `Sudid` event. Zombienet upgrade tests
    now use this helper and consume the compact (`WASM_BINARY`) runtime instead
    of `WASM_BINARY_BLOATY`, avoiding `max_code_size` overflows in debug builds.
crates:
- name: cumulus-zombienet-sdk-helpers
  bump: minor
- name: cumulus-zombienet-sdk-tests
  bump: none
